%N A199399 Binary XOR of 5^k as k varies from 0 to n.
%H A199399 Robert Israel, <a href="/A199399/b199399.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..1422</a>
%e A199399 a(2) = 1 XOR 5 = 4; a(3) = 1 XOR 5 XOR 25 = 29; a(4) = 1 XOR 5 XOR 25 XOR 125 = 96.
%p A199399 R:= 1: r:= 1:
%p A199399 for k from 1 to 30 do
%p A199399   r:= MmaTranslator[Mma]:-BitXor(r,5^k);
%p A199399   R:= R,r
%p A199399 od:
%p A199399 R; # _Robert Israel_, Aug 26 2026
%o A199399 (PARI) {a(n)=if(n<0,0,bitxor(a(n-1),5^n))}
